{:frontmatter
 {:id "adr-2606271600-kotoba-stack-equivalences"
  :title "ADR-2606271600: kotoba ≅ wasmCloud⊗Spin⊗clj⊗Datomic⊗Radicle / security posture"
  :status "proposed"
  :doc_type "adr"
  :topic "architecture-positioning"
  :authoritative true
  :last_verified "2026-06-28"
  :authoritative_for
  ["kotoba を CID+Datom+WASM の1基板の5つの顔として位置づける語彙"
   "kotoba の Radicle 対応は protocol 実装ではなく役割対応であること"
   "kotoba private data の security boundary は selective replication ではなく object encryption に置くこと"
   "age/sops/gpg と kotoba envelope encryption の使い分け"
   "post-quantum / hybrid KEM / hybrid signature を前提にした crypto agility 要件"]
  :related
  ["orgs/com-junkawasaki/kotoba"
   "orgs/com-junkawasaki/kotoba/crates/kotoba-git"
   "orgs/com-junkawasaki/kotoba/crates/kotoba-dht"
   "orgs/etzhayyim/root/80-data/kotoba-rad"
